{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "```python\ndef modp(n: int, p: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates 2^n modulo p using modular exponentiation by squaring.\n    This method efficiently handles large integer inputs by taking modulo at each step.\"\"\"\n    result = 1\n    base = 2 % p\n\n    while n > 0:\n        if n % 2 == 1:\n            result = (result * base) % p\n        base = (base * base) % p\n        n //= 2\n    return result\n```"}
