{"task_id": "HumanEval/61", "solution": "```python\ndef _validate_bracket_characters(brackets: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the input string consists solely of '(' and ')' characters.\n    Returns True if valid, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n    for char in brackets:\n        if char not in ('(', ')'):\n            return False\n    return True\n\ndef correct_bracketing(brackets: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a string has correctly matched and ordered parentheses.\n    Returns True for correct bracketing, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n    if not _validate_bracket_characters(brackets):\n        return False\n\n    balance = 0\n    for char in brackets:\n        if char == '(':\n            balance += 1\n        elif char == ')':\n            balance -= 1\n        if balance < 0:  # Closing bracket appeared before an opening one.\n            return False\n\n    return balance == 0 # True if all opened brackets were closed.\n```"}
